---
import PhoneCTA from '../ui/PhoneCTA.astro';
import Eyebrow from '../ui/Eyebrow.astro';

interface Props {
  eyebrow?: string;
  headline?: string;
  bg?: 'white' | 'alabaster';
}

const { eyebrow, headline = "Repair or Replace? Make the Right Call.", bg = 'white' } = Astro.props;
const bgClass = bg === 'white' ? 'bg-white' : 'bg-brand-alabaster';
---

<section class={`py-20 md:py-32 bg-white relative`}>
  <div class="max-w-[90rem] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-20 flex flex-col items-center">
      {eyebrow && <Eyebrow text={eyebrow} centered={true} />}
      <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-heading font-black text-brand-charcoal uppercase tracking-tight leading-[1.1] mb-6">{headline}</h2>
      <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-gray-600 font-sans leading-relaxed">Not sure if your garage door needs a simple fix or a complete overhaul? Here is how professionals evaluate the situation.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 lg:gap-12">
      
      <!-- Repair Column -->
      <div class="bg-brand-alabaster p-10 md:p-12 rounded-3xl shadow-lg border border-gray-100 hover:shadow-xl transition-shadow">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-white rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center shadow-sm mb-8">
           <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-green-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M11 5H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v11a2 2 0 002 2h11a2 2 0 002-2v-5m-1.414-9.414a2 2 0 112.828 2.828L11.828 15H9v-2.828l8.586-8.586z"></path></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-3xl font-heading font-black text-brand-charcoal mb-4">When to Repair</h3>
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 mb-8 font-sans">Repair is usually the best option when the door is structurally sound but a specific mechanical component has failed.</p>
        <ul class="space-y-5 font-sans text-gray-700 font-medium">
          <li class="flex items-start">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-green-600 mr-4 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="3" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>
            <span>A torsion or extension spring has snapped.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-green-600 mr-4 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="3" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>
            <span>The door has derailed but the panels are undamaged.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-green-600 mr-4 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="3" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>
            <span>The opener motor hums but doesn't move.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-green-600 mr-4 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="3" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>
            <span>Only one panel is dented from a minor impact.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Replace Column -->
      <div class="bg-brand-charcoal p-10 md:p-12 rounded-3xl shadow-2xl relative overflow-hidden group hover:-translate-y-2 transition-transform duration-300">
        <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-64 h-64 bg-brand-accent/20 rounded-full blur-3xl -mr-20 -mt-20 z-0 transition-transform group-hover:scale-150 duration-700"></div>
        <div class="relative z-10">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-brand-accent rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center shadow-lg shadow-brand-accent/30 mb-8">
             <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 4v5h.582m15.356 2A8.001 8.001 0 004.582 9m0 0H9m11 11v-5h-.581m0 0a8.003 8.003 0 01-15.357-2m15.357 2H15"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-3xl font-heading font-black text-white mb-4">When to Replace</h3>
          <p class="text-lg text-gray-400 mb-8 font-sans">Replacement makes financial sense when the door's structural integrity is compromised or the system is completely obsolete.</p>
          <ul class="space-y-5 font-sans text-gray-300 font-medium">
            <li class="flex items-start">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-brand-accent mr-4 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="3" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z"></path></svg>
              <span>Severe wood rot, widespread rust, or major warping.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-brand-accent mr-4 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="3" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z"></path></svg>
              <span>Multiple panels are crushed from a vehicle impact.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-brand-accent mr-4 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="3" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z"></path></svg>
              <span>The door lacks basic safety features and insulation.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-brand-accent mr-4 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="3" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z"></path></svg>
              <span>You need to drastically improve curb appeal.</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <div class="mt-16 text-center">
      <PhoneCTA label="Get a Professional Assessment" />
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
